	bool "Auto-generate Intel FSP version info in SBOM"
	depends on SBOM_INTEL_FSP && FSP_USE_REPO
	default y
	help
	  When enabled, coreboot extracts the FSP version from the FSP git
	  repository (3rdparty/fsp) commit history and includes it in the SBOM.
	  If disabled, set SBOM_INTEL_FSP_PATH to a custom file that already
	  contains version information.

